{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hancui-e-0a31489ebc3aeb6747d7","title":"王观奏涿为外剧郡不避送任子","accounts":[{"id":"hancui-a-0a31489ebc3aeb6747d7","label":"正文","text":"王观奏涿为外剧郡不避送任子","evidence":["hancui-q-6ff78d9179e1e4276416"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0139","role":"奏郡等送任子","evidence":["hancui-q-6ff78d9179e1e4276416"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hancui-q-6ff78d9179e1e4276416"]},"ordering_evidence":"hancui-q-6ff78d9179e1e4276416","order":5002}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0139","name":"王观","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-6ff78d9179e1e4276416","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-5a08ff2bcae0dbc73de2","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即位，下诏书使郡县条为剧、中、平者〖8〗。主者欲言郡为中、平，观教曰：“此郡滨近外虏，数有寇害，云何不为剧邪〖9〗？”主者曰：“若郡为外剧，恐于明府有任子〖10〗。”观曰：“夫君者，所以为民也。今郡在外剧，则于役条当有降差〖11〗。岂可为太守之私，而负一郡之民乎？”遂言为外剧郡，后送任子诣邺。时观但有一子而又幼弱。其公心如此。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":417,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":166,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
